  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8fa5e4b6d0f7e82f4d81c13",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "剩下的时间不多，鲁道夫象征却还是\n游刃有余的样子。最后在丸善斯基的协助下，\n赶上了集训开始的时间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79f59f75d2d67101dfd0499dd92890eb9a954ccc6b16a359220d960fbe36445c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94040229a58c9cb273d3e6a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第二年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e193ad94ba56712a8e92ed87a15587d1a6af48670f61e354efcb818a0837f0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b76ed989cf0818311522581b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训开始了。\n鲁道夫象征态度悠哉，与去年完全相反。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85c3e0a006cb394eaf667f2d740404d217b3da5269333ecd52434527da22a1f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:848c3abe958be59b2213628f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征这次选择以\n特雷森学园学生的身份，体验集训的序幕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50c3d1c3df9d8908b95e59fb6159105d445674ef60e2d02729247a5edc486480",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f334c2d75283b934dce848d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第三年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef37080660583492caac78b957b8f144bbb2896156162385fc6034f5649e4df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1daa844cc0914d4cdb6193b3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "由于受瞩目的鲁道夫象征将迈向出道战，\n外头的气氛热烈到让人以为这是重赏比赛。\n她认为这股压力反而是好机会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "076f876090fc15a1ada24ecf74039f3aadcc3fcf89f9acd0e22c4e028005ef5b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dec2d4f130b766956de0ae7b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征一如往常，\n威风凛凛地走向了出道战的赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73d2111c32be0aa84d3a09710d5e6beea86b4d3a828db97b57baf21f520636ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33b352976802cb09d1fb77b0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向出道战",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea754365577b70c3247fb413fa7b90388e1e4a185a1da5f6c50ef25fe13c496",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8053e91a49581a41c893b43",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“沙特阿拉伯RC”比赛开始前，\n之前的新人──崇拜着鲁道夫象征的\n学生会庶务来帮她加油了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a368769045e5bd14407bb4e03c3be9200e5957d9f24910496c14c159d886048",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7826c65156c263071aa8c8e3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征要求那位赛马娘观赛，\n而她默默地点了头。\n鲁道夫象征接着便沉着地迎向了比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8125203ea9148b2f453878b11332cfa24434c9b6ec4ee302154f415468b45fa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efd77041881596132cbfacb9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向沙特阿拉伯RC",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a3618ebfdb70609791ff3f032513888f8718bfe559520f76dbe3efe999038c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be9519efad92c75a2c7501c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征因为“皋月赏”在即而情绪高昂，\n但是她连这种时候，都对没有人找她商量\n学生会的问题而耿耿于怀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0b35491c0f0863d22c4da90efebeeff55f88cc1d84c27f7729b859f2c1acf8d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5599242e26b9e2c0c272905d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她决定要一直维持完美无缺的样子。\n为了变成更强大、更值得依赖的“皇帝”，\n她动身走向跳板──“皋月赏”的起点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22309e9772104bbcb43e9a5442fab81f812bc115f337b289b482844bf072cb4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e557513c46ac0afc2b0e4c75",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向皋月赏",
      "source_fingerprint": "83ff224a61598a6c666007568d7268968b6f324292cc2eee89e3b5acc428c30a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d66de6c315752a4a4e89f85",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能够让人赢得无限可能的“日本德比”。\n肩负训练员还有许多人梦想的她，\n不自觉地绷紧了神经。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31a06aff1c36cd4f4acc5ceae89b45dcf884fe56d715cf44770164f2f5329943",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da1d2e8f42d4ddf8a2c6276d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过在训练员的声援之下，\n鲁道夫象征恢复了冷静。\n“皇帝”怀抱着理想，从容地走向战场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "927833f1b32fee1de0008e131b6910400c49b948334089b404bcfd9c40aedbf4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd64c1199affc2f7d43eb7aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向日本德比",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4074326c9093437fbf37c8e5b00d67df67963c2eed1109506df4b11f06953bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:812b264a9999425376c97185",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只有最强的赛马娘才能取胜的“菊花赏”。\n虽然这是个大舞台，\n鲁道夫象征却还是气定神闲的样子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f23acfc8d7e990ae40e5d81686aedff5728bc45b070832c86ab0459025834973",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb24f8e625f275e1d83befcf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这场比赛的优胜绝对不能让给其他人。\n鲁道夫象征与训练员一同迈出步伐，\n走向遥远的巅峰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9367407c69d7cd65a9b142d88c73303f434721ca868238de6e1ccf77aef46ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95594041c2a8291b46680058",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向菊花赏",
      "source_fingerprint": "c32fe703b345a297a6972e4f3115aec53ea8a9931382257ccb6b146928c5537e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc3466f3dfa99e9351c4058a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "休息室外头的人们都在谈论鲁道夫象征。\n虽然她备受瞩目，\n但粉丝投票的结果却是第二名。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dc9982c49c87f062e379a7d3d529cb32820f26c5b6b40a02aa545b9858816b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3adf726afd242528f610f53",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然如此，就拿出不容质疑的实力吧──\n鲁道夫象征与训练员以坚定不移的决心\n迎向了“有马纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98748c8d1ed33acc625d93ac7481d20a22ea7fc62e8bbf6b0b2014f66e3e0aff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93aed5f5e1179f5f9c8b4e67",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向有马纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "a28480a57275928fde3ca335c4e37d5670b04bf8228df0e3cc61294de9b176ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9269c72fabb546e2ae066753",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征的双眼没有一丝迷惘。\n她看清了自己该前进的方向，\n试图在传统的赛事上铭印自己的名字。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ed3ac8b2325c0f4f8ce02de2c42413b2ff0abbb98037f537d3557ffa3eef038",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efaf52642a05c715fb46c060",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "浴火重生的“皇帝”鲁道夫象征，\n将在“天皇赏（春）”造成轰动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "001fe27afb5d6bad3d736c57d9d1b812869a41f08d96ca88dc2062bdae227b95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da16202a834caaffcd675ed1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向天皇赏（春）",
      "source_fingerprint": "787a30dcdda7188675e08b67055e274860a6c1346bc76e36d7243b3c8364986b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d833131acefbcc990035bcc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“日本杯”开始前的休息室，\n鲁道夫象征正在与\n今天跟她比赛的后辈们互相寒暄。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad3ca70a940b2810d9ba9b9e51a46a51ae80381c5a1507767345895e5f4d81b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d82f95ff6511a8624984be82",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "纵使思绪驰骋于记忆的长河之中，\n鲁道夫象征也不会因此大意。\n她身为强者，唯一的任务就是尽“皇帝”本分。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c563adc9ea1b644e38733a77ad4c3915172c46270c217fb2d1d41ffb4e841a9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
