    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:191a38d72bb681fd60d1f40b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向日本杯",
      "source_fingerprint": "a194ff2b11e4dc29465b7e96ba46fa50af90ca4fdbd5410a9fadda438e8fdd1a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b875e6f4ddbaa5104470af0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“怪物”丸善斯基\n与“皇帝”鲁道夫象征的世纪对决。\n每个人都热烈讨论着输赢将会落入谁的手里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e67abcd7fdfffd2919643c904acb8b920d32c02ace5a1e381e4cf271dd0db71",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4171f58bce49dedbc191bdaf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而当事者也不例外。\n两人擦出激烈火花，斗志表露无疑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f86c7efc7de2ab07b8ad89a60b61e94bd4b115c79d77bb6da2cb3590845dc0a8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9123f50833c5968112370233",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赢家是“皇帝”还是“怪物”──\n在无数观众的期待之下，决斗即将展开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "590d5a5dbc9ef78fb2d24fd1c8fb20c42a171310710320dc9eafe451267758e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a76ac07575f97eba0bfd8e3e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向有马纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "a28480a57275928fde3ca335c4e37d5670b04bf8228df0e3cc61294de9b176ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7343784f96df8450808f0f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征顺利出道。\n她为了在经典赛前做好万全准备，\n决定参加“沙特阿拉伯RC”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b5efeb9c9ca0f67b72a87302eae46bc90ae86f514f91eceedec58a7437f2c1a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5774daad5aac990a52b7986",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使刚跑完比赛，她仍然平静地\n面对采访，还有处理学生会的工作。\n这正是她身为会长，以及“皇帝”的自尊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ba5d5827eaf9fe3e17aa44efb20394e0cd90d19c88d1b7232afcc1856028d24",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2487cf6d34cc00b975fd06c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀的她很少仰赖训练员的帮忙。\n不过，为了帮助她实现梦想，\n训练员下定决心要尽自己所能给予支援。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d0cae6bc3fc9ec30dcc74ed46129405dc072b3deb01be3b9f7c1a30fe869fcd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d08ea9645472ca3acd88348d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・开始进攻",
      "source_fingerprint": "919c372332390d9dbd822ebbce3c293361c314c0e7c56fe1362e98067383c915",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39e625668ad8aa49cf0b0768",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征漂亮地赢得第一名后，\n对“皋月赏”雄心万丈。担任庶务的赛马娘\n却因此感到自己与她相差甚远。",
      "source_fingerprint": "188879f7f03acb796b8d3885c879fd430ac66fed5d8537347932acc0141b1af1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ce3a6c2dd546f3ee2a6e659",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在那之后，两人碰上了“怪物”丸善斯基。\n她与鲁道夫象征一样实力坚强，\n也是炒热赛马娘界气氛的选手之一。",
      "source_fingerprint": "059edfaacdf34c925bcc9a6ca3011d04adeb0878fb4840ff1da7a59b745173ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18aed9041c7002e076a0501a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果与丸善斯基对战，\n鲁道夫象征会带来什么样的表现呢？\n训练员的思绪飘向了不知何时会成真的未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6949954092e624b6e8eeebd4733fd3a6e9c30d97d2bca3c0d829f9d7c915ab3b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67770659a39e2483b301f395",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "沙特阿拉伯RC结束后・势如破竹",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bc3ec1a0e2521ec1e663f3c7f8af54f74174729025f1f2418d863ba7ea1c828",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24f9ba661c771d13150a9279",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征在错失第一名后自我警惕，\n决定要在“皋月赏”赢得优胜。担任庶务的\n赛马娘因此觉得鼓足干劲的她离自己很遥远。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91335f858770d86a774ef12b6ff55ae429ac7b288e4a8c62e66e370d2bccfedb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bebcb23b94a1c93fa809a0e0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在那之后，两人碰上了“怪物”丸善斯基。\n她与鲁道夫象征一样实力坚强，\n也是炒热赛马娘界气氛的选手之一。",
      "source_fingerprint": "059edfaacdf34c925bcc9a6ca3011d04adeb0878fb4840ff1da7a59b745173ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b33e63cd4de1901810daef6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果与丸善斯基对战，\n鲁道夫象征会带来什么样的表现呢？\n训练员的思绪飘向了不知何时会成真的未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6949954092e624b6e8eeebd4733fd3a6e9c30d97d2bca3c0d829f9d7c915ab3b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:714a335d9a892762035e0d39",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "沙特阿拉伯RC结束后・鸿鹄之志",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4c380d99ea28b7feb36bc260137c3a40d43e27e77982a69417debc9ee356bd4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8516fdb59173c7c2099f355a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在皋月赏赢得优胜的鲁道夫象征\n高高举起一根手指，表示自己取得了第一冠。\n下一个目标是“日本德比”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b91809dd3425100fafe69a6a3b01de99585fb08d57bb45ccf5748c187772c162",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bcc8c6799bac23a46039967",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在那之后，气槽与担任庶务的赛马娘\n来到了休息室。鲁道夫象征真挚地\n向她们说出自己的梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dd550933d51de827f31189d122c7787c7340dd0987cbadd30de73e657d73388",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61baa92d36d0654db415f56b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "担任庶务的赛马娘明白鲁道夫象征的想法后，\n答应留在学生会。而站在一旁的气槽\n却似乎有些不甘心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80782c08c9cbff3b6207ef78ad35794949e8e3eee0a4171c2e37c9b1f0590708",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e525bc07ad3d991b0ddee22",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "皋月赏结束后・达成一冠",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c8cb20635298292b31f4d1e0044d47ebfea141af4524cc14b24971b64c87278",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e7e3643a7ccfc2c59ca2833",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "三冠的目标化为泡影了。\n但是，接下来的“日本德比”绝对要获胜。\n鲁道夫象征的斗志之火尚未熄灭。",
      "source_fingerprint": "959a5685e186c1ce95f35f189046c0833a5dc6b8fe7c601719845a4c90b60ef9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d01385d3d099705f80ddf9a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在那之后，气槽与担任庶务的赛马娘\n来到了休息室。鲁道夫象征真挚地\n向她们说出自己的梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dd550933d51de827f31189d122c7787c7340dd0987cbadd30de73e657d73388",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ba29fff6759095af30908cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "担任庶务的赛马娘明白鲁道夫象征的想法后，\n答应留在学生会。而站在一旁的气槽\n却似乎有些不甘心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80782c08c9cbff3b6207ef78ad35794949e8e3eee0a4171c2e37c9b1f0590708",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
